ntence:\n\n\"$z$ is rational or $z$ is rational, or it is a positive number.\"\n\nNow, we simplify the phrase \"$z$ is rational or $z$ is rational\" to just \"$z$ is rational.\" The sentence now reads\n\n\"$z$ is rational, or it is a positive number.\"\n\nFinally, we simplify the sentence to\n\n\"$z$ is rational or positive.\"" #edb/ref 17592186045417]}
